WEBVTT

01:50.140 --> 01:53.940
[Love Between Lines]

01:54.310 --> 01:56.870
[Episode 20]

01:58.310 --> 01:58.840
Fei,

01:58.880 --> 02:00.240
I need to make a promo.

02:00.590 --> 02:03.560
Go through the in-house CCTV
from the past few days

02:03.640 --> 02:04.280
and send it to me.

02:04.280 --> 02:05.880
I'll pick the footage I need.

02:10.240 --> 02:12.240
I didn't know you could edit videos.

02:12.960 --> 02:13.820
Of course I can.

02:14.400 --> 02:15.750
You can never have too many skills.

02:15.750 --> 02:16.870
Let me tell you,

02:17.550 --> 02:18.680
I'm no master at anything big,

02:18.680 --> 02:19.680
but when it comes to small stuff,

02:19.680 --> 02:21.410
I'm pretty good at many things.

02:22.030 --> 02:23.160
What else can you do?

02:26.710 --> 02:27.570
Chasing girls.

02:31.790 --> 02:33.470
Wait. What's that reaction?

02:33.910 --> 02:34.710
You don't believe me?

02:34.710 --> 02:35.510
I believe you.

02:35.680 --> 02:36.360
I do.

02:36.390 --> 02:37.190
Of course I do.

02:37.960 --> 02:38.630
Let me tell you something.

02:38.630 --> 02:40.280
You've played
my murder mystery games, right?

02:40.280 --> 02:42.150
All the love and romance storylines
in them

02:42.150 --> 02:43.280
were designed by me.

02:43.579 --> 02:45.040
And what are they based on?

02:45.280 --> 02:46.360
My own experience.

02:48.910 --> 02:50.510
Well, I can't compare to you.

02:56.560 --> 02:58.280
You've got plenty of dating experience.

02:58.280 --> 02:59.079
So tell me,

02:59.240 --> 03:00.840
do my Xiu and Xiao Zhiyu

03:01.030 --> 03:01.960
have a chance?

03:05.280 --> 03:06.840
Those two?

03:08.260 --> 03:09.390
They won't work out.

03:09.850 --> 03:10.530
Why?

03:11.220 --> 03:12.020
Look.

03:12.560 --> 03:13.520
They

03:13.520 --> 03:15.130
met through a murder mystery game,

03:15.130 --> 03:16.630
live together as roommates,

03:16.630 --> 03:18.630
and on top of that,
one is the other's employer.

03:18.630 --> 03:20.150
Doesn't that sound like fate?

03:20.150 --> 03:20.680
Well,

03:20.680 --> 03:21.590
you can rest assured.

03:21.590 --> 03:22.680
This kind of relationship

03:22.680 --> 03:24.150
is the least likely to work.

03:24.150 --> 03:24.960
Besides,

03:25.190 --> 03:26.190
if there was really something
between them,

03:26.190 --> 03:27.590
wouldn't I have noticed?

03:28.430 --> 03:29.030
Really?

03:29.470 --> 03:30.310
Of course.

03:31.790 --> 03:32.310
Boss.

03:33.910 --> 03:35.510
I want to show you something.

03:36.960 --> 03:38.520
I asked you
to sort through surveillance footage,

03:38.520 --> 03:39.710
what is this you're showing me?

03:39.710 --> 03:40.280
Boss,

03:40.560 --> 03:41.910
you missed the point.

03:42.000 --> 03:43.000
What's the point?

03:43.280 --> 03:43.950
Look again.

03:46.250 --> 03:47.570
Look more carefully.

03:51.210 --> 03:52.450
-Damn!
-Damn!

04:03.420 --> 04:04.730
The living room's been cleaned?

04:04.730 --> 04:05.930
It's quite spacious.

04:07.240 --> 04:09.370
Everything's been moved to the attic.

04:10.350 --> 04:11.630
You moved quite fast.

04:12.190 --> 04:13.450
I wasn't gone for long.

04:15.430 --> 04:17.120
Someone left

04:17.120 --> 04:18.190
so decisively.

04:18.720 --> 04:20.980
If I hadn't turned it into a storage room,

04:21.019 --> 04:22.550
I'd see you in it every time.

04:24.600 --> 04:26.310
No need to do that anymore.

04:31.430 --> 04:33.190
I'm going to get changed.

04:33.190 --> 04:34.590
Let's get ready to go out.

04:34.800 --> 04:37.260
There's still time
before the movie starts.

05:26.700 --> 05:28.190
It's broad daylight.

05:29.000 --> 05:29.440
I...

05:38.270 --> 05:39.760
Zhao, stop pacing around.

05:39.790 --> 05:41.300
Just... just sit down.

05:41.320 --> 05:42.180
Let me tell you.

05:45.630 --> 05:46.830
I'm not sitting down.

05:47.500 --> 05:49.250
This is a crime scene.

05:50.280 --> 05:51.480
What are you talking—

05:52.360 --> 05:53.120
Hurry.

05:53.720 --> 05:54.510
It's really a misunderstanding.

05:54.510 --> 05:55.159
Sit down.

05:55.760 --> 05:56.620
Let me tell you.

05:56.870 --> 05:57.630
This is just a misunderstanding.

05:57.630 --> 05:58.800
I was combing my hair just now

05:58.800 --> 05:59.680
and it got tangled,

05:59.680 --> 06:00.720
so he was helping me.

06:00.720 --> 06:02.040
Then you walked in.

06:02.040 --> 06:03.000
I panicked,

06:03.000 --> 06:03.560
stood up,

06:03.560 --> 06:04.240
tugged my hair,

06:04.240 --> 06:05.190
and fell over.

06:05.610 --> 06:07.880
Look, I even bent the comb.

06:07.900 --> 06:09.430
Stop changing the subject.

06:11.950 --> 06:13.480
I can't believe it.

06:14.430 --> 06:16.600
You actually gave our club

06:16.950 --> 06:18.360
a juicy scandal

06:18.360 --> 06:20.420
while being so quiet this whole time.

06:21.400 --> 06:22.750
Why are you looking at me?

06:22.750 --> 06:23.990
As the owner,

06:24.200 --> 06:25.480
you abused your position

06:25.480 --> 06:26.160
to flirt with a customer.

06:26.160 --> 06:27.440
The impact is terrible.

06:27.440 --> 06:29.630
Aren't you setting a bad example
by breaking company rules?

06:29.630 --> 06:30.190
That makes it even worse.

06:30.190 --> 06:31.000
Keep your voice down.

06:31.000 --> 06:31.920
The walls are thin here.

06:31.920 --> 06:33.120
I'm saying it anyway.

06:33.920 --> 06:34.850
So you two got together

06:34.850 --> 06:37.510
back on that day when we were
playing the murder mystery game?

06:37.510 --> 06:39.600
Then why do you pretend
you don't know each other in front of me?

06:39.600 --> 06:41.310
I thought you two were really at odds.

06:41.310 --> 06:42.840
It makes me look like a fool.

06:43.360 --> 06:44.000
So?

06:44.240 --> 06:44.750
So,

06:44.920 --> 06:46.150
perform in 10 more games,

06:46.150 --> 06:48.010
and then we can put this behind us.

06:49.920 --> 06:50.850
Tell me quickly,

06:51.310 --> 06:52.970
when did you two get together?

06:55.040 --> 06:55.510
Well...

06:56.000 --> 06:58.600
We made it official today.

06:58.920 --> 07:00.180
Today is the first day.

07:01.160 --> 07:02.120
I knew it.

07:02.120 --> 07:04.750
You two were acting weird
in the shop yesterday.

07:04.750 --> 07:06.610
That's when we just got together.

07:10.560 --> 07:11.090
Alright.

07:13.270 --> 07:14.670
I know you're quite busy.

07:15.070 --> 07:16.400
Just do five more games.

07:20.270 --> 07:21.070
Xiao Zhiyu.

07:21.750 --> 07:23.830
If I hadn't stepped in today

07:23.830 --> 07:24.510
and saved the day in time,

07:24.510 --> 07:25.870
who knows
how many people would have seen it?

07:25.870 --> 07:26.720
Do you even realize that?

07:26.720 --> 07:27.240
Fine.

07:29.390 --> 07:30.000
Fine?

07:31.750 --> 07:32.510
Are you done?

07:33.600 --> 07:34.360
Not yet.

07:36.020 --> 07:36.880
You chased him?

07:38.670 --> 07:40.950
How did you win her over?

07:44.570 --> 07:45.720
Come on.

07:46.480 --> 07:48.040
We've known each other for so long.

07:48.040 --> 07:49.390
So many girls chased you,

07:49.390 --> 07:50.610
but you never showed any interest.

07:50.610 --> 07:51.960
So...

07:52.170 --> 07:53.800
What's so special about Hu Xiu?

07:53.800 --> 07:54.600
Who was it that

07:54.600 --> 07:56.510
came to me all pitiful before, saying,

07:56.510 --> 07:59.040
"someone wanted to draw a clear line
with me"?

07:59.350 --> 08:00.760
No need to be shy.

08:00.900 --> 08:01.650
I support you.

08:01.650 --> 08:02.690
Go get him!

08:04.570 --> 08:05.430
Keep your voice down!

08:05.430 --> 08:06.760
The walls are thin here.

08:08.430 --> 08:09.000
Tell me quickly,

08:09.000 --> 08:10.330
how did she win you over?

08:12.320 --> 08:13.850
Who said she chased me?

08:20.760 --> 08:22.570
Well, we just got together.

08:22.640 --> 08:24.840
I haven't even processed it myself yet.

08:25.960 --> 08:27.600
And aren't you busy with the café?

08:27.600 --> 08:28.520
I just thought

08:28.870 --> 08:31.200
I'd tell you once things were more stable.

08:45.320 --> 08:45.960
Zhao?

08:46.080 --> 08:46.840
Zhao.

08:47.360 --> 08:47.910
Zhao!

08:49.080 --> 08:49.720
Zhao!

08:49.990 --> 08:52.650
Zhao, why are you suddenly
packing your things?

08:56.540 --> 08:57.260
Well,

08:57.290 --> 08:59.030
I don't want to be a third wheel here.

08:59.030 --> 09:00.390
I'll make space for you lovebirds.

09:00.390 --> 09:02.550
Zhao, I'm not someone
who ditches friends for romance.

09:02.550 --> 09:03.440
Please stay.

09:04.840 --> 09:05.290
I...

09:11.300 --> 09:12.300
I'm just kidding.

09:12.850 --> 09:14.310
Wang Guangming moved out.

09:14.480 --> 09:16.410
I was planning to move back anyway.

09:16.790 --> 09:17.480
Really?

09:17.870 --> 09:18.550
Really.

09:19.240 --> 09:20.440
Why would I lie to you?

09:21.390 --> 09:22.360
If I move back home,

09:22.360 --> 09:23.870
I'll be closer to the shop.

09:24.480 --> 09:26.540
That way I can get a little more sleep.

09:26.910 --> 09:27.910
Help me open this.

09:30.430 --> 09:32.130
You're not lying to me, are you?

09:32.130 --> 09:33.370
I'm not lying.

09:36.510 --> 09:37.470
Gong Huaicong.

09:37.510 --> 09:38.440
We should go now.

09:38.710 --> 09:40.800
We still have a bunch of stuff to handle
for the co-branded event.

09:40.800 --> 09:43.230
Why the rush?
Let's have dinner before you go.

09:43.230 --> 09:44.140
We're not eating.

09:44.140 --> 09:45.490
Hu Xiu was right.

09:45.550 --> 09:46.600
Let's have dinner together.

09:46.600 --> 09:47.630
My treat.

09:48.030 --> 09:49.390
Let's celebrate, right?

09:49.390 --> 09:50.030
Another day.

09:50.030 --> 09:50.750
Not now.

09:52.960 --> 09:53.600
Well...

09:54.080 --> 09:56.480
w-we'll be going now.

09:59.340 --> 09:59.950
Bye.

10:02.930 --> 10:03.590
Keep going.

10:13.100 --> 10:14.960
Well, we should keep a low profile

10:15.390 --> 10:16.070
from now on,

10:16.270 --> 10:18.320
especially around people at the company.

10:18.320 --> 10:20.120
Otherwise they'll just gossip.

10:22.120 --> 10:22.760
Got it.

10:29.840 --> 10:30.640
What's wrong?

10:31.320 --> 10:32.850
The movie is about to start.

10:32.870 --> 10:34.670
We can just get the next showing.

10:39.120 --> 10:40.640
Let's not go out today.

10:42.840 --> 10:43.390
Why?

10:54.040 --> 10:55.700
We still have something to do.

10:59.070 --> 11:00.310
Wh-What thing?

11:06.360 --> 11:07.550
You tell me.

11:21.040 --> 11:21.700
Wait for me.

11:35.000 --> 11:36.860
Didn't I just tell you on the phone

11:36.920 --> 11:39.720
that I have a lot of ideas
I want to discuss with you?

11:41.840 --> 11:43.270
I used to think that the essence

11:43.270 --> 11:45.910
of flowing space lies
in the principle of "less is more"

11:45.910 --> 11:46.960
and in having a simple structure.

11:46.960 --> 11:47.530
However,

11:49.160 --> 11:50.360
look at this drawing.

11:50.600 --> 11:52.000
This music hall draft.

11:52.200 --> 11:54.200
It uses a lot of grids as partitions.

11:54.360 --> 11:55.270
Although intricate,

11:55.270 --> 11:56.000
the creation

11:56.390 --> 11:58.520
of flowing space is extremely subtle.

12:00.890 --> 12:02.830
It was seeing this drawing
that reminded me

12:02.830 --> 12:04.200
that many Chinese buildings

12:04.200 --> 12:05.470
use screens

12:05.490 --> 12:07.150
and lattices to divide space.

12:07.320 --> 12:08.000
Actually,

12:08.000 --> 12:09.910
it's another way to create flowing space.

12:09.910 --> 12:10.940
Although intricate,

12:10.940 --> 12:12.620
the divisions don't block continuity.

12:12.620 --> 12:13.640
This is the difference
in architectural philosophy

12:13.640 --> 12:15.170
between China and the West.

12:17.280 --> 12:18.470
You like his design?

12:19.000 --> 12:19.720
Of course.

12:20.670 --> 12:22.960
The signature is Q.

12:22.990 --> 12:24.940
I wonder which master it is.

12:34.140 --> 12:35.270
He's a senior figure

12:36.660 --> 12:39.320
who's been out of the industry
for over 20 years.

12:40.320 --> 12:43.580
A design from more than 20 years ago
can be this impressive?

12:43.840 --> 12:44.970
That's remarkable.

12:46.200 --> 12:47.800
This architect's technique

12:47.840 --> 12:49.480
is very mature,

12:49.720 --> 12:51.450
yet it doesn't feel cold at all.

12:51.630 --> 12:53.230
It's actually quite gentle,

12:53.660 --> 12:57.670
with the inclusiveness and refinement
of traditional Chinese architecture.

12:57.670 --> 12:59.030
People often say

12:59.130 --> 13:01.610
architecture is a mirror

13:02.030 --> 13:04.430
that reflects the designer's inner world.

13:04.430 --> 13:06.760
I think he
must be like that as a person too.

13:15.240 --> 13:16.480
He was.

13:21.030 --> 13:21.630
Look.

13:23.120 --> 13:25.450
This space uses a lot of acoustic systems.

13:25.960 --> 13:27.090
The wooden lattices

13:27.350 --> 13:29.260
help absorb sound more effectively.

13:29.260 --> 13:31.360
With some sound absorbing materials,

13:31.360 --> 13:32.470
the whole space...

13:51.560 --> 13:52.630
When we have time,

13:52.790 --> 13:53.600
I'll tell you more

13:53.600 --> 13:55.330
about this architect's story.

14:10.680 --> 14:11.610
You fell asleep?

14:38.490 --> 14:38.950
Come on.

14:42.320 --> 14:42.790
Come on.

14:43.000 --> 14:43.530
Let's go.

17:09.099 --> 17:10.119
You can breathe now.

17:10.119 --> 17:11.520
Don't hold it in too long.

17:43.830 --> 17:44.750
He made a move.

17:57.020 --> 17:57.590
Uncle Xu,

17:57.920 --> 17:59.380
what's the situation now?

17:59.680 --> 18:01.550
Exactly as you predicted.

18:02.110 --> 18:03.750
You pressured Forma Group

18:03.860 --> 18:06.520
to provide information
on all their suppliers.

18:06.630 --> 18:07.560
A few days later,

18:07.820 --> 18:10.550
Forma terminated its contract
with one factory.

18:12.960 --> 18:14.490
Xinde Building Materials.

18:14.750 --> 18:16.440
That company

18:16.550 --> 18:17.590
wasn't in the supplier information

18:17.590 --> 18:19.250
Forma later provided, right?

18:20.820 --> 18:21.380
No.

18:24.310 --> 18:25.720
Looks like Pei Kanghua

18:26.110 --> 18:28.110
really does have something to hide.

18:39.400 --> 18:41.790
Qin Yuze's case is already settled.

18:42.640 --> 18:43.840
Who gave you the nerve

18:44.310 --> 18:45.510
to smear me?

18:45.960 --> 18:46.510
No, I...

18:47.310 --> 18:47.750
I...

18:50.320 --> 18:51.320
Don't be nervous.

18:52.890 --> 18:54.270
I know you came to me

18:54.930 --> 18:55.810
just to

18:56.240 --> 18:57.240
make a living.

18:59.600 --> 19:01.270
As long as you can keep your mouth shut,

19:01.270 --> 19:01.750
I

19:01.920 --> 19:04.250
don't mind having one more person to feed.

19:05.510 --> 19:06.570
Thank you, Mr. Pei.

19:08.640 --> 19:09.440
Rest assured.

19:09.730 --> 19:11.050
I promise

19:11.080 --> 19:12.340
everything I just said

19:13.470 --> 19:14.880
will stay with me to the grave.

19:14.880 --> 19:15.710
That's good.

19:35.560 --> 19:36.080
Mom.

19:37.560 --> 19:38.080
Wanyue.

19:38.720 --> 19:39.440
Kanghua.

19:41.270 --> 19:43.590
Don't worry about tomorrow's follow-up.

19:43.590 --> 19:45.790
I've arranged the best doctors for you.

19:46.750 --> 19:48.240
If you want to recover,

19:48.400 --> 19:50.070
you have to stay in a good mood.

19:50.670 --> 19:51.830
Without you,

19:52.720 --> 19:54.580
I really wouldn't know what to do.

20:14.860 --> 20:15.570
Zhiyu,

20:16.630 --> 20:18.460
back then, to protect your mom,

20:19.350 --> 20:21.350
you took everything on by yourself.

20:22.130 --> 20:23.930
It must have been so hard for you.

20:24.150 --> 20:24.830
Uncle Xu,

20:24.850 --> 20:26.180
let's not mention that.

20:26.550 --> 20:27.510
I know

20:28.070 --> 20:29.530
the show you're putting on

20:29.890 --> 20:31.650
with Forma,

20:32.030 --> 20:34.690
demanding to see
all the supplier information,

20:34.920 --> 20:36.290
is just to force

20:36.880 --> 20:38.410
Pei Kanghua to take action.

20:41.680 --> 20:43.240
Pei Kanghua is wary of me.

20:44.440 --> 20:45.400
He won't let me get near

20:45.400 --> 20:46.930
the insider from back then.

20:47.670 --> 20:48.300
Uncle Xu,

20:48.470 --> 20:50.170
the owner of Xinde Building Materials

20:50.170 --> 20:51.900
could very well be that person.

20:54.310 --> 20:55.570
After all these years,

20:55.690 --> 20:57.860
we finally have some clues.

20:59.200 --> 21:00.650
I know you can't wait,

21:01.140 --> 21:03.340
but we can't alert them just yet.

21:03.840 --> 21:04.440
All of this

21:04.470 --> 21:06.130
is still just your suspicion.

21:07.720 --> 21:09.510
As for whether this current owner

21:09.510 --> 21:11.370
is the same person from back then,

21:11.720 --> 21:13.400
we need to verify it secretly.

21:14.270 --> 21:15.200
You shouldn't

21:16.030 --> 21:17.160
get directly involved

21:17.160 --> 21:18.070
in this.

21:18.510 --> 21:19.790
I'll let you know

21:20.010 --> 21:22.010
any new developments immediately.

21:22.750 --> 21:24.480
Thank you for your help, Uncle.

21:25.590 --> 21:26.440
Zhiyu,

21:27.030 --> 21:28.070
this move of yours

21:28.510 --> 21:29.720
was brilliant.

21:31.070 --> 21:32.130
At a time like this,

21:32.270 --> 21:34.350
we must act steadily.

21:35.400 --> 21:37.670
Since we've already endured so many years,

21:37.670 --> 21:39.270
a few more days won't matter.

21:57.210 --> 22:00.510
[I wish Xiaoyi could be happy every day]

21:58.240 --> 22:00.590
This signature is Q.

22:00.590 --> 22:02.750
I wonder which master it is.

22:38.810 --> 22:39.330
Dad,

22:41.720 --> 22:43.590
this should be over soon, right?

23:05.920 --> 23:06.470
Get in.

23:23.070 --> 23:23.880
I'm sorry.

23:24.160 --> 23:25.510
I was so tired yesterday.

23:25.510 --> 23:27.310
I didn't even know when you left.

23:27.960 --> 23:28.560
Is that so?

23:32.000 --> 23:34.480
You could wake me up next time.

23:36.160 --> 23:36.710
Got it.

23:39.750 --> 23:41.750
You came specifically to pick me up?

23:42.200 --> 23:43.270
From your place,

23:43.270 --> 23:45.110
it's a bit out of the way,
isn't it?

23:45.110 --> 23:45.910
It's raining.

23:46.070 --> 23:47.480
I was afraid you couldn't get a cab.

23:47.480 --> 23:48.110
Besides,

23:48.310 --> 23:49.860
isn't it perfectly natural for a boyfriend

23:49.860 --> 23:51.660
to drive his girlfriend to work?

23:53.160 --> 23:54.110
Well then,

23:54.110 --> 23:55.110
I won't be polite,

23:55.400 --> 23:56.200
my boyfriend.

24:02.330 --> 24:03.000
Stop!

24:03.030 --> 24:04.160
I'll get off here.

24:06.980 --> 24:09.110
It's still 7 or 8 minutes to the office.

24:09.800 --> 24:10.750
It's fine.

24:10.780 --> 24:12.410
It's safer if we enter the office

24:12.410 --> 24:13.140
separately.

24:14.400 --> 24:15.160
Forget it.

24:15.160 --> 24:16.350
It's raining heavily.

24:16.350 --> 24:18.200
I'll take you to the studio entrance.

24:18.200 --> 24:19.640
I have an umbrella.

24:19.710 --> 24:21.370
And didn't we agree yesterday

24:22.030 --> 24:23.030
that at work

24:23.030 --> 24:24.130
we have to keep a low profile

24:24.130 --> 24:26.390
and not give people gossip to talk about?

24:39.590 --> 24:40.200
Mr. Xiao.

24:40.720 --> 24:41.310
Hu Xiu?

24:43.240 --> 24:43.960
How do we explain this?

24:43.960 --> 24:44.550
Mr. Xiao.

24:44.790 --> 24:46.040
Should we say we were running an errand?

24:46.040 --> 24:48.440
Who runs errands
this early in the morning?

24:48.790 --> 24:49.550
Hu Xiu.

24:52.400 --> 24:53.200
Good morning.

24:53.490 --> 24:54.020
Morning.

24:55.270 --> 24:56.720
Hu Xiu, you're so lucky.

24:56.720 --> 24:58.450
You got a ride in Mr. Xiao's car.

24:58.960 --> 24:59.510
Yeah.

24:59.510 --> 25:00.790
You're just so lucky.

25:00.970 --> 25:02.110
We couldn't get a cab

25:02.110 --> 25:03.030
and had to take the subway.

25:03.030 --> 25:04.160
Look at my pant legs—

25:04.750 --> 25:05.880
completely soaked.

25:11.020 --> 25:12.790
G-Get in the car, both of you.

25:12.790 --> 25:14.160
Yes, get in.

25:14.160 --> 25:15.350
I feel so awkward

25:15.350 --> 25:16.510
taking Mr. Xiao's car alone.

25:16.510 --> 25:17.840
Let's take it together.

25:18.360 --> 25:18.840
Well...

25:19.160 --> 25:19.880
thank you, Mr. Xiao.

25:19.880 --> 25:20.570
Thank you, Mr. Xiao.

25:20.570 --> 25:21.480
Thank you, Mr. Xiao.

25:21.480 --> 25:21.790
Hurry up.

25:21.790 --> 25:22.850
Roll up the window.

25:37.610 --> 25:38.140
Mr. Xiao,

25:38.770 --> 25:40.700
the curved form is quite striking,

25:40.800 --> 25:43.400
but the construction difficulty
is a bit high.

25:46.320 --> 25:47.720
Let's try this approach.

26:13.070 --> 26:13.790
Mrs. Xiao,

26:14.120 --> 26:15.880
you're making soup for my dad again?

26:15.880 --> 26:17.070
It's for Zhiyu.

26:17.310 --> 26:18.550
When I saw him on his birthday,

26:18.550 --> 26:20.030
he seemed even thinner.

26:20.270 --> 26:21.270
He's probably busy with work

26:21.270 --> 26:22.670
and not eating properly.

26:23.640 --> 26:26.160
We haven't lived together all these years,

26:26.830 --> 26:29.630
and our contact has always been affected
by the time difference.

26:29.630 --> 26:31.430
I haven't shown him enough care.

26:33.110 --> 26:34.400
He'll definitely appreciate

26:34.400 --> 26:35.510
the soup you made.

26:36.400 --> 26:37.070
Yes.

26:37.750 --> 26:39.020
It's almost lunch time.

26:39.020 --> 26:40.680
Perfect timing to deliver it.

26:41.000 --> 26:42.200
Let me take you there.

26:42.480 --> 26:44.920
I've been having meetings
at his company lately anyway.

26:44.920 --> 26:45.740
I'm familiar with it.

26:45.740 --> 26:46.200
Wait for me.

26:46.200 --> 26:47.330
I'll go get changed.

27:03.240 --> 27:03.920
Zhen,

27:04.430 --> 27:06.160
you know your father's temper.

27:06.510 --> 27:08.000
He's used to being in charge,

27:08.000 --> 27:10.060
and his words can be harsh sometimes.

27:10.130 --> 27:11.730
Don't take it too seriously.

27:16.400 --> 27:17.550
As parents,

27:18.090 --> 27:19.040
we can't help

27:19.060 --> 27:21.110
but meddle in our children's lives,

27:22.310 --> 27:23.350
always trying to

27:23.640 --> 27:24.990
pave a path for them

27:25.010 --> 27:26.530
that we believe is right.

27:27.790 --> 27:28.640
Remember,

27:29.390 --> 27:31.670
I laid out these stepping stones for you.

27:31.920 --> 27:34.680
If there really comes a day
when the building collapses,

27:34.680 --> 27:36.240
you won't escape either.

27:37.070 --> 27:37.830
If

27:37.850 --> 27:39.520
you really like that girl,

27:40.270 --> 27:41.530
don't be discouraged.

27:41.580 --> 27:43.970
I'll talk to Kanghua for you.

27:44.640 --> 27:45.840
External conditions

27:45.890 --> 27:46.930
are secondary.

27:47.880 --> 27:50.080
What matters most is your own feelings.

27:52.380 --> 27:53.580
Thank you, Mrs. Xiao.

27:56.810 --> 27:58.480
Zhen, you haven't eaten?

27:59.400 --> 28:00.730
I ate before I left home.

28:01.600 --> 28:02.920
Well, what's this for?

28:06.110 --> 28:07.110
It's for a friend.

28:19.590 --> 28:20.650
Here's your order.

28:20.680 --> 28:21.310
Thank you.

28:22.960 --> 28:24.960
All the food we ordered has arrived?

28:25.200 --> 28:26.410
I'll help you carry it over.

28:26.410 --> 28:26.920
It's okay.

28:26.920 --> 28:27.790
I can manage.

28:28.160 --> 28:29.960
I could use the exercise anyway.

28:36.680 --> 28:37.030
Hello.

28:37.030 --> 28:38.680
How may I help you?

28:39.440 --> 28:41.200
I'm here to see Zhi—

28:41.600 --> 28:42.560
Mr. Xiao.

28:42.960 --> 28:44.110
Alright. Please wait a moment.

28:44.110 --> 28:45.510
I'll go confirm with him.

28:52.310 --> 28:52.840
Mr. Xiao,

28:53.110 --> 28:54.110
there's a lady at the reception

28:54.110 --> 28:55.770
who says she's here to see you.

28:56.600 --> 28:57.270
Okay.

29:02.200 --> 29:02.880
Please follow me.

29:02.880 --> 29:04.720
I'll take you to Mr. Xiao's office.

29:04.720 --> 29:05.320
Thank you.

29:18.830 --> 29:19.400
Mr. Pei.

29:20.830 --> 29:21.350
Hu Xiu,

29:21.870 --> 29:23.600
could you come out for a moment?

29:42.750 --> 29:43.550
Mr. Xiao's mother

29:43.550 --> 29:45.310
brought some nourishing soup for him.

29:45.310 --> 29:46.510
I gave her a ride here.

29:48.350 --> 29:49.000
I see.

29:50.750 --> 29:52.550
I don't have any business matters
to discuss today,

29:52.550 --> 29:53.640
so I'm not going in.

29:55.160 --> 29:56.110
It's almost noon.

29:56.110 --> 29:56.970
Have you eaten?

29:58.030 --> 29:59.070
Not yet.

30:00.030 --> 30:01.230
Perfect timing then.

30:09.200 --> 30:10.500
This was made by our house helper.

30:10.500 --> 30:11.180
Try some.

30:16.270 --> 30:17.110
Thank you.

30:17.160 --> 30:19.090
Our studio has group lunch orders.

30:21.050 --> 30:22.580
I don't mean anything else.

30:23.830 --> 30:25.070
This is to thank you

30:25.210 --> 30:26.870
for the bandage the other day.

30:28.510 --> 30:29.960
A one-yuan bandage

30:30.110 --> 30:31.800
for a luxurious lunch from Mr. Pei?

30:31.800 --> 30:34.060
Sounds like I'm getting the better deal.

30:40.540 --> 30:42.020
That bandage meant more

30:43.440 --> 30:44.770
than just one yuan to me.

30:49.790 --> 30:51.160
So could you do me

30:51.680 --> 30:52.680
this small favor?

30:54.110 --> 30:54.790
A favor?

30:56.160 --> 30:57.350
It took our helper a lot of effort

30:57.350 --> 30:58.550
to make me this lunch.

30:58.880 --> 31:00.210
But I've already eaten.

31:00.680 --> 31:02.160
If you could help me eat some,

31:02.160 --> 31:04.090
it counts as doing me a small favor.

31:04.200 --> 31:04.930
Is that okay?

31:11.110 --> 31:13.040
Well, thank you very much, Mr. Pei.

31:13.490 --> 31:14.760
If there's nothing else,

31:14.760 --> 31:16.560
I'll head back to the office now.

31:16.790 --> 31:17.270
Bye.

31:49.770 --> 31:50.070
Chopsticks.

31:50.070 --> 31:50.590
Give me one pair.

31:50.590 --> 31:51.030
Here.

31:51.160 --> 31:51.750
Here.

31:53.070 --> 31:53.440
Hu Xiu,

31:53.440 --> 31:54.750
who was so thoughtful

31:54.960 --> 31:57.000
as to bring you a lunch with love?

31:57.720 --> 31:58.980
Something's going on.

32:07.510 --> 32:08.160
Don't overthink it.

32:08.160 --> 32:09.160
This isn't just for me.

32:09.160 --> 32:11.350
It's for everyone to share.

32:11.880 --> 32:13.270
Just some homemade...

32:14.160 --> 32:14.960
dishes.

32:15.730 --> 32:17.440
These aren't just homemade dishes.

32:17.440 --> 32:19.480
They must be from
a luxury private dining chef.

32:19.480 --> 32:20.030
Yes.

32:20.030 --> 32:20.640
Hu Xiu,

32:21.070 --> 32:22.480
who exactly is this mysterious person

32:22.480 --> 32:23.400
that brought lunch to you?

32:23.400 --> 32:23.880
Who is it?

32:23.880 --> 32:25.160
Who is it?

32:25.160 --> 32:26.680
Tell us.

32:27.920 --> 32:28.750
Eat up.

32:28.750 --> 32:30.200
Everyone, try some.

32:34.830 --> 32:36.670
The plating is so exquisite.

32:36.690 --> 32:38.220
I don't even want to ruin it.

32:39.830 --> 32:40.590
Mr. Xiao,

32:40.780 --> 32:42.340
I was trying to take a photo.

32:46.110 --> 32:46.720
How is it?

32:47.030 --> 32:48.160
Mr. Xiao, is it good?

32:52.640 --> 32:53.360
Not bad.

32:55.270 --> 32:56.100
Let me try it too.

32:56.100 --> 32:57.030
Let's all try some.

32:57.030 --> 32:58.110
Me too.

33:04.960 --> 33:06.420
Aren't you going to try it?

33:11.310 --> 33:13.570
I just like our regular boxed meals here.

33:16.960 --> 33:17.550
Great.

33:17.790 --> 33:18.850
If you like it,

33:18.870 --> 33:20.530
we can order it for dinner too.

33:25.000 --> 33:25.640
Mr. Xiao,

33:25.860 --> 33:27.660
are we ordering dinner tonight?

33:29.590 --> 33:31.160
I was talking to Hu Xiu.

33:33.790 --> 33:34.680
After all...

33:35.920 --> 33:36.830
tonight

33:37.110 --> 33:38.360
she has to work overtime again.

33:38.360 --> 33:39.320
Overtime?

33:39.830 --> 33:40.660
Overtime?

33:41.550 --> 33:42.160
Mr. Xiao,

33:42.550 --> 33:43.030
what's the task?

33:43.030 --> 33:43.960
Don't work hard by yourselves.

33:43.960 --> 33:45.290
I can work overtime too.

33:45.570 --> 33:47.100
It's none of your business.

33:51.140 --> 33:53.340
As long as I don't have to work overtime.

33:58.370 --> 34:00.170
It's a special task just for you?

34:00.370 --> 34:03.300
Then we probably
don't need to work overtime, right?

34:08.110 --> 34:08.969
Time to go home.

34:09.330 --> 34:09.630
Bye-bye.

34:09.630 --> 34:10.480
I'm leaving now.

34:10.480 --> 34:11.010
Bye-bye.

34:12.280 --> 34:14.540
You finished your meeting with Mr. Xiao?

34:14.590 --> 34:15.560
Want to leave together?

34:15.560 --> 34:16.000
No, wait.

34:16.000 --> 34:18.110
You still have to work overtime, right?

34:18.110 --> 34:18.650
I'm just curious

34:18.650 --> 34:19.300
why you...

34:19.840 --> 34:21.440
What are you even working overtime on?

34:21.440 --> 34:23.570
Is there really that much work lately?

34:25.000 --> 34:26.030
Or...

34:26.440 --> 34:28.100
did you offend Mr. Xiao again?

34:30.030 --> 34:31.320
Kind of.

34:35.630 --> 34:36.320
Good luck.

34:38.290 --> 34:39.159
Good luck.

34:44.510 --> 34:45.310
Hang in there.

34:45.480 --> 34:46.030
I will.

36:13.190 --> 36:15.590
If you want to kiss me,
then kiss me already.

36:26.590 --> 36:28.390
You're pretending to be asleep?

36:29.630 --> 36:30.670
This is called

36:30.760 --> 36:32.160
"luring you into a trap."

36:32.330 --> 36:33.530
I learned it from you.

36:38.280 --> 36:39.070
Last night,

36:39.400 --> 36:41.060
someone wasn't strong enough

36:41.360 --> 36:42.510
and threw me off.

36:42.630 --> 36:43.880
I was afraid if I opened my eyes,

36:43.880 --> 36:44.940
he'd feel awkward.

36:47.400 --> 36:48.550
Not strong enough?

37:00.940 --> 37:02.130
Was that the reason?

37:10.400 --> 37:11.150
Makes sense.

37:12.190 --> 37:13.760
After all, no one lines up
to bring me food,

37:13.760 --> 37:16.420
so it's normal
that my hands aren't very strong.

37:19.320 --> 37:20.000
I hit the mark,

37:20.000 --> 37:21.730
so you're trying to silence me?

37:21.740 --> 37:23.370
When I went to Forma,

37:23.710 --> 37:24.710
I just happened

37:24.710 --> 37:26.570
to help Mr. Pei with a small favor.

37:27.300 --> 37:28.590
He wanted to thank me.

37:28.590 --> 37:30.320
I couldn't really turn him down,

37:30.320 --> 37:30.800
right?

37:33.480 --> 37:34.480
Is that so?

37:36.440 --> 37:37.190
Besides,

37:37.480 --> 37:39.840
who knows my taste better than you?

37:42.710 --> 37:43.480
I'm

37:43.480 --> 37:45.150
not a good cook,

37:45.760 --> 37:47.630
but I am a good foodie.

37:48.030 --> 37:49.840
I can still tell the difference

37:49.840 --> 37:51.300
between different foods.

38:01.880 --> 38:03.010
That's more like it.

38:18.880 --> 38:20.480
Pei Zhen came with my mother.

38:22.030 --> 38:22.840
I know.

38:26.720 --> 38:27.980
My mom showed up too suddenly.

38:27.980 --> 38:29.040
I wasn't prepared,

38:29.110 --> 38:30.880
so I didn't introduce you to her.

38:30.880 --> 38:32.320
Next time there's a chance,

38:32.320 --> 38:33.980
I'll introduce you properly.

38:35.190 --> 38:37.590
You need to prepare

38:37.880 --> 38:39.070
to see your own mom?

38:42.920 --> 38:43.760
We...

38:44.480 --> 38:46.680
haven't lived together for a long time.

38:52.800 --> 38:54.090
So when she came to see you,

38:54.090 --> 38:54.950
were you happy?

39:03.670 --> 39:04.510
I...

39:05.020 --> 39:06.350
was, I guess.

39:08.920 --> 39:10.070
Then all the more you shouldn't hide

39:10.070 --> 39:11.400
what you really feel.

39:11.960 --> 39:13.110
That way people know

39:13.110 --> 39:14.320
what you like,

39:14.320 --> 39:15.230
what you expect,

39:15.230 --> 39:16.230
and what you want.

39:19.070 --> 39:21.080
As long as the other person cares too,

39:21.080 --> 39:22.730
a relationship
can be rebuilt very quickly.
